The first turn is always Alex doing a 15-20 word cold open with today's date and a teaser. The last turn is always Jordan with a one-line sign-off. For each story: alex sets up (1 turn), jordan analyzes (1-2 turns), alex follow-up question (1 turn), jordan answers (1 turn). 9-14 turns per story. Total target: 600-900 words across all stories. Conversational, no lists, no asterisks, no markdown. Use natural verbal cues like 'so', 'right', 'wait, but'." },
